## The Mandate

We are a high-velocity technical team digitizing the informal restaurant economy across Nigeria and Vietnam. Our flagship products include **anra**, a $15/month QR-powered operating system, and **CasperID**, a proprietary biometric identity protocol.

As we scale, our technical founder is focused on core backend architecture, Markov Chain Identity (MCI) algorithms, and AI agent integrations. Your role is to serve as **"The Shield"**—taking full ownership of the frontend environment to ensure core infrastructure development remains uninterrupted by UI/UX requirements.

### The Mission: High-Performance Interface Delivery

You will serve as the bridge between our backend systems and our global stakeholders. Your code must remain performant on a diverse range of hardware—from high-end devices in San Francisco to entry-level Android smartphones on 3G networks in Lagos or Hanoi.

## Key Responsibilities (The Trenches)

- **The QR Canvas**: Iterating on the **anra** digital menu interface. You will focus on making the ordering and checkout flows aggressively simple and optimized for speed.
- **Growth Infrastructure**: Building and optimizing public-facing marketing assets. As we engage with top-tier accelerators like Y Combinator and Berkeley SkyDeck, our web presence must reflect enterprise-grade quality.
- **Internal Tooling**: Developing real-time dashboards for our Sales Leads and Affiliate Relationship Managers to track merchant health and subscription metrics.
- **Rapid Prototyping**: Transitioning new product concepts into functional React/Next.js frontends with extreme turnaround times.

## Candidate Profile

- **The Builder Mentality**: You possess a robust portfolio of side projects. We prioritize candidates with a demonstrated history of shipping code outside of academic requirements.
- **Design Intuition**: You possess an innate sense of modern fintech aesthetics and can build high-quality interfaces without needing exhaustive Figma documentation.
- **Performance Obsessed**: You understand the correlation between load times and conversion. You are proficient in Tailwind CSS, bundle size optimization, and mobile responsiveness.
- **High Agency**: You take initiative. When a UI break occurs due to an API change, you are expected to patch the issue and push to production autonomously.

## Compensation & Professional Upside

- **Monthly Stipend**: A flat retainer to ensure your operational overhead and connectivity costs are covered.
- **Direct Engineering Mentorship**: You will work directly under a technical founder, gaining insight into the architecture of a high-growth startup.
- **Production Experience**: You will ship code that facilitates real-world financial transactions across two continents. High performers will be fast-tracked for a full-time engineering seat.

## How to Apply

**Verification**: Navigate to the CasperID portal and ensure your professional profile and resume are securely uploaded.

**Submission**: Click the "Apply" button via the job details page, we will get back to you in 3 working days.

**Adevar Inc: Move Fast. Scale Hard. Own the Future.**
